  "description": {
   "en": "Since ancient times, the arcane arts have been used as tools of political strife and weapons of war. Practitioners of these arts, known as spellcasters, sought to ensure the survival of their kind by demonstrating the utility of their powers to the government.\n\nHowever, as the ages passed and the number of spellcasters grew, momentum built within the arcane community to reassess their societal standing. It was in this climate that a nation of spellcasters—commonly known as the Eastern Enchantment—was born. And the governing body of this land came to be called… the Empyreal Cabinet.\n\nThe curtain rises on an arcane saga of magnificent scale, right now!!\n___\n**Additional Links:**\n- [Official X](https://x.com/tembodaikaku)",
   "ja": "掲載時のカラーページを完全収録!!】古来より《祕術》は政争の具や兵器として使われ、祕術を操る《術者》は為政者にその力の有用性を示すことで種の存続を図った。しかし、時代の流れと共に術者の人口が増加、祕術界では術者の社会的地位を見直す機運が高まる。そして誕生したのが通称《東仙境》と呼ばれる術者の郷国（くに）。その統治機関を人々はこう呼ぶ《天傍台閣》と。　壮大なスケールで贈る祕術大河、ここに開幕――!!"
  },
